{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "840bd825cc29b9c0eb68d67c2cb8cebf5e081bc2ad6ceba7071eae311a7450c9", "ja": "（今日は、昴が出演する学園ドラマの撮影がある。\n待ち時間の間、キャッチボールをしていたのだが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄昴出演的校园剧。\n等待拍摄的时间里，我们本来在玩接球……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b1c9c55e5d97e49eff0ebfbb9b5e2a9f57bb3f8c5936a77b39dcdfe8c679a9d0", "ja": "あいたたた……。", "zh": "好痛痛痛……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "c5784a3b002c8f469d073fba8277b9b9e28dc03e30a544d65911200aa6cda135", "ja": "だ、大丈夫か、{$P$}！？\nうわっ。手、擦りむいちゃってるじゃん。", "zh": "没、没事吧，{$P$}！？\n哇，你的手都擦破了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "3920496287978db192e0a073b5f83ddfc9a6d0cc4d995b25cd6d412a0f5a2fe3", "ja": "オレ、薬箱借りてくる。\nすぐに戻るから、ちょっと待ってて！", "zh": "我去借药箱。\n马上就回来，等我一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "d0baa0b675f7fb9115ea93096394650d0ceba71f0ad552060426311fa644e922", "ja": "よし、これで終わり！\n消毒したとこは、触っちゃだめだからな！", "zh": "好，这样就处理完啦！\n消毒过的地方，可不能碰哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5c757f144d16673ad9b187715c2e23232aeceb0480187929c92662fcfc5c4e63", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう昴。\nそういえば、ドラマにもこんなシーンがあったよな。", "zh": "啊，谢谢你，昴。\n说起来，电视剧里也有这样的场景呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "5349bf69f3a78afb6d529f19ec9d4222ca7940b6c2e29f4eaf8f465f194d7713", "ja": "あっ、そうだな！\nそういえば、ドラマを撮影してる時も……。", "zh": "啊，对啊！\n说起来，拍摄电视剧的时候也是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "d0bfd003475da7b8f972b46036d21b84728216a074e81f7fc1416722b6f03459", "ja": "オレが手当してやったヤツのこと、なんか\n{$P$}みたいだな～って思ったんだ。", "zh": "我给处理过伤口的那家伙，总觉得有点\n像{$P$}呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6aad65cea946b340e88d3bf4e8ac15fe9a0d5d8468dcbf323ce90cf1291ed6c4", "ja": "俺みたい？", "zh": "像我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "748ddb6ddd84fcf32ce2f70abe870f09a0b52455101a21d8941c5bac6610a541", "ja": "うん！　自分だってケガしてるのに、\nオレに「手当てしろ！」ってうるさく言ってきてさ。", "zh": "嗯！明明自己也受了伤，却还一直吵着让我“赶紧处理伤口！”大小规律", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "9f0e9ebad59adbb57c4a95d2de8e9020532694bbd115e9afc66285e876ff1c83", "ja": "そういうところ、なんか\n{$P$}みたいだろ？", "zh": "在这种地方，感觉有点像{$P$}，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1012_p", "source_sha256": "976d0b1d29764964177fe9c099e8b4d0db012bd99f9dc7babdb3b5728dab195a", "ja": "はは、そうか。つまり昴は俺の事を、\nちょっと口煩いと思ってるんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。也就是说，昴觉得我有点爱唠叨，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "8b1207136abb68752206042cf663186dd6640280ee0758bd3b203838d9ce3e46", "ja": "うっ……だ、だって、ホントのことだし！\nちょっと擦りむいたら、すぐ消毒しろとかさ……。", "zh": "呜……可、可是，这本来就是事实嘛！\n只是稍微擦破点皮，就非要我马上消毒之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1014_p", "source_sha256": "16aad9c976e577888d34cc48a9e2700f88736f3a7275a2328c6d229afa3f38b2", "ja": "それは当然だろ。小さな傷でも悪化したら困るし、\n昴は劇場の大事なアイドルだ。それに……。", "zh": "那当然了。就算是小伤口，恶化了也很麻烦，\n昴可是剧场重要的偶像。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "e504e62ff427d5a42d642dc530a8cb62036fdb38068d1d40963153eb178feb6d", "ja": "それに？", "zh": "而且？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e734102c084c4870aa1cf2b556e9e80698e3a40c3c71396b418638e395261224", "ja": "ひとりの、かわいい女の子だからな！\nご家族から預かっている以上、傷はつけられないよ。", "zh": "毕竟是个可爱的女孩子嘛！\n既然是家人托付给我的，我可不能让她受到伤害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "37b5183f6bc55b49c097e392e0c3813e6e60d7566db011d50a107f3d4b04f06d", "ja": "ふ、ふ、ふーん。そっか。\nそういう考え方もあるんだな……。", "zh": "呃、呃、呃——原来如此。\n还有这种想法啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "e1f34d3af04f201a470c55c02c7cca30119f8b5091e63f9287c8d73e3901f510", "ja": "オレ、てっきり{$P$}が\n痛いの苦手なのかと思ってたぜ。", "zh": "我还以为{$P$}怕疼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1019_p", "source_sha256": "71748a7689243152e2053ff1438d8624d6e090c9704151e40505fdabd99b46b9", "ja": "いや、確かに痛いのは好きじゃないけど……\nただアイドルに、ケガはつきものだろ。", "zh": "倒也不是，虽然我确实不喜欢疼……\n只是对偶像来说，受伤是常有的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f58e4ff5a726eb1c1cadada4b7e825e0ec54fd9f354977e31a2eba26c5a63508", "ja": "レッスンや撮影で擦りむく事くらい、今後も\nあるだろうけど。アフターケアは万全のつもりだよ。", "zh": "虽然今后也可能会在练习或拍摄时擦伤之类的，但我会尽力做好完善的后续护理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "edfb186429d11682f585ca8b99ce9836bdb72167bbfb6c004af39f8890b7a694", "ja": "うん、サンキュな！　{$P$}が\n注意してくれるせいか、オレも生傷が減ったしな～。", "zh": "嗯，谢了！多亏{$P$}提醒我，我身上的新伤也变少了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "129b0486c9fd93be66102b814117f0daae84541261dddf648855e679b1393554", "ja": "最近は、父さんや兄ちゃんたちに怒られることも\n減ったし。これからもよろしくな！　へへ♪", "zh": "最近被老爸和哥哥们骂的次数也少了。以后也请多关照！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0163_1023_p", "source_sha256": "dbf6edb68fe68535aa1cb90fec04a0bdc5d3ecdc441284eb019c03f0d3bf13c4", "ja": "（やっぱり、昴の家族は心配してたんだな……\nこれからも生傷には気をつけた方が良さそうだ！）", "zh": "（看来昴的家人果然一直很担心她啊……以后也得注意别再添新伤了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
